{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06665","headline":"奉和中书徐侍郎中书省玩白云寄頴阳赵大 · 储光羲","name":"奉和中书徐侍郎中书省玩白云寄頴阳赵大","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青阙朝初退，白云遥在天。\n非关取雷雨，故欲伴神仙。\n泛灩鵷池曲，飘颻琐闼前。\n犹多远山意，幸入侍臣篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}